Changes:
 mcomix (3.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * New upstream release.
     - Fix keyboard shortcuts with newer GTK versions.
     - Store thumbnails according to the XDG Thumbnail specification.
     - Add a GLib-based file sort order.
   * Drop 02_fix_runtime_error_context_already_been_set.patch, applied
     upstream.
